    "site_desc": "Continuous, irrigated, sugarcane cultivation for >100 years.  Practice is to grow plant sugarcane for 2 years, drydown, burn leaves, harvest cane, and then till and replant very shortly after harvest.  First cycle of observations were from July 2011 to November 2012.  Second cycle was from April 2013 to December 2013.  Site differs from Sugarcane Windy and Sugarcane Middle in soil type and meteorology.",
